# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if platform is rather diverse, it may prevent installing
#   packages in some cases (e.g. package not finding its dependencies for current platform).
#   Pipfile.lock

